<title>JAPAN: Japan Oil Trans - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Oil Trans - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.58		vs	    7.73</p>
<p> Operating	  361 million	 vs	  341 million</p>
<p> Current	    537 million	 vs	  508 million</p>
<p> Net		  279 million	 vs	  238 million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.52 yen	  vs	    7.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     33 million	  vs	  32 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Oil Transportation Co Ltd is a transporter of oil and chemical products and is affiliated with Nippon Oil Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
